  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/9f1f11fbb4e091305a6b414e74c3aec25b8d519670a1f3bd65f5bd4eb1bdcd68.png] \n\nGiven equation: ÷ and +\n\n**Option 1) 76 ÷ 4 × 2 - 90 + 3 = 54**\n\nAfter interchanging the signs:\n\n⇒ 76 + 4 × 2 - __**90 ÷ 3**__ = 54\n\n⇒ 76 + __**4 × 2**__ - 30 = 54\n\n⇒ __**76 + **____8__ - 30 = 54\n\n⇒ **__84__**__** - 30**__ = 54\n\n**⇒ 54 = 54**\n\nOption 2) 8 + 4 × 5 ÷ 4 - 6 = 7\n\nAfter interchanging the signs:\n\n⇒ __**8 ÷ 4 × 5**__ + 4 - 6 = 7\n\n⇒ __**10**____** **__+ 4 - 6 = 7\n\n⇒ __**14**__**__ -**__ 6** **= 7\n\n⇒ 8 ≠ 7\n\nOption 3) 8 + 4 × 5 ÷ 2 - 6 = 18\n\nAfter interchanging the signs:\n\n⇒ __**8 ÷ 4 × 5**__ + 2 - 6 = 18\n\n⇒ __10** + 2**__ - 6 = 18\n\n⇒ **__5__**__** - 6**__ = 18\n\n⇒ -1 ≠ 18\n\nOption 4) 9 × 18 + 27 ÷ 36 - 45 = -4\n\nAfter interchanging the signs:\n\n⇒ __**9 × 18 ÷ 27**__ + 36 - 45 = -4\n\n⇒ __6__ __**+ 36**__ - 45 = -4\n\n⇒ __**42**____** - 45**__ = -4\n\n⇒ -3 ≠ -4\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"**76 ÷ 4 × 2 - 90 + 3 = 54**\".",
